<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>

<content contentuid="h47d2cee6gd74eg4e98gb24dg33f9d5e71388" version="1">Mantle</content>
<content contentuid="hba8f343fg530eg4a37g88ccg6700b383fec9" version="1">U'kra casts her own suffering over an ally like a cloak. While the Patient One draws breath, the warded creature &lt;b&gt;cannot be harmed&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hf247c13cg8782g4a39ga41cgb3e818b41f4f" version="1">Ferocious Aid</content>
<content contentuid="h2b5b8facg6602g4ed2gb236g712ed67db5cf" version="1">U'kra bellows a battlefield prayer, filling an ally with another's life. Grants &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to maximum &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hb36a4ea8gb4b4g425fg9c95g237ae91d3efb" version="1">Bestial Heritage</content>
<content contentuid="hbfe85cd2g79f2g42fdgad0ag43cb966a319f" version="1">The buried raider tears loose. For this turn U'kra gains &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; additional &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action Points&lt;/LSTag&gt; and deals &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; damage, until her prayer pulls the beast back into Blessed Calm.</content>

<content contentuid="h1b126d5eg1113g462cg8e20gab84cc6e0b14" version="1">Compassion</content>
<content contentuid="hd67ce1ccg1a5fg4637g89ecgaacc6ed2ce9e" version="1">When U'kra heals an ally, that ally also gains &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;Temporary Hit Points&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hcdc20e5ag4e7eg4ca6gabaeg8833a6c6f90d" version="1">Intercession</content>
<content contentuid="h69df4e69g0956g4344g81deg3f56244830f4" version="1">When U'kra heals an ally below &lt;b&gt;half&lt;/b&gt; their &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt;, she restores an additional &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h84bc8e28g20c5g44b8gb5b4g859e6cdae7ab" version="1">Retribution</content>
<content contentuid="h1e8ed970gfdd3g420fga2d8g30e6c10c6f74" version="1">Strike the Patient One in melee and the beast in her answers, dealing &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; and inflicting &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeding&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h5d4e35d6gf7a9g4f0bga323gd201ae3497da" version="1">U'kra the Enduring</content>
<content contentuid="hce65eecegaf5bg40f7g8534ge5238b31d9a7" version="1">Mantle of the Meek</content>

<content contentuid="h7da05225gd3afg4519gb3aag01efe02ec1b7" version="1">Mantle of Suffering</content>
<content contentuid="h8c5ca7c8ged53g4ad5gb063g0a6bb6dc9d4a" version="1">U'kra casts her own endurance over the most dangerous of her allies; while the Patient One lives, that ally &lt;b&gt;cannot be harmed&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h67f04d16gc331g4256gb2d4g49b0b6453354" version="1">Bestial Heritage</content>
<content contentuid="h7db58815g66adg4584gb7e5g2367245f8bf9" version="1">U'kra keeps the beast leashed by healing her allies. If she ends 2 turns in a row without healing an ally, Bestial Heritage triggers for 1 turn: she gains &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; additional &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action Points&lt;/LSTag&gt; and deals &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; damage with attacks and spells. When it ends, she returns to Blessed Calm.</content>

<content contentuid="h956a371eg0519g4d9eg90c5ge155f2d326f5" version="1">Blessed Calm</content>
<content contentuid="hc23a554cg5021g49c1g92b8g765dc109dd94" version="1">Her prayer holds and the beast lies still. Deny U'kra the mercy of healing for too long, and Bestial Heritage breaks loose.</content>

<content contentuid="he924289dg4970g4738g8493g17a6aa3d480f" version="1">Strike me, not them. I will endure. They will not.</content>
<content contentuid="h406648e9g519dg45e9gb3b9g78dd1115bae0" version="1">The Dark One sends me. No joy in it, but I can still finish you.</content>
<content contentuid="ha2cadda8g5eedg4d2fg9c20gd3ae2aafaee0" version="1">Come. Spend your wrath on me. That much is mercy.</content>
<content contentuid="h3a35460cg1620g4e9fga730g8033801c12c0" version="1">Endure. Endure. Just do not... do not break.</content>
<content contentuid="h7e9f8622gc3a5g46ddgb44ag9c7bc1022193" version="1">Hands at my sides. Hands at my sides.</content>
<content contentuid="h6795b29bg1a66g4102ga980ge2f68e0025a2" version="1">Not the skull. Not today. Breathe.</content>

<content contentuid="h6c799583gd39cg4658g9ae7gdf66318df3f3" version="1">He endured, and so must we!</content>
<content contentuid="he5b39bfagffebg4547g85b5gd229648f64da" version="1">Ilmater shields you!</content>
<content contentuid="h153d63b7g8643g4306g9ba5g8bfd36126c6d" version="1">Just focus on the healing... focus...</content>
<content contentuid="hbeb62ef6g9392g4698ga7a5g4a28b3989ac6" version="1">Uzg uzg... tar, tar!</content>
<content contentuid="h524311e7g1ca0g4f45g95e0gd945beaf41ef" version="1">ANYONE ELSE?!</content>

<content contentuid="hf6ce6302ga56cg46edga5acg8ef9cf0433ff" version="1">Don't you DARE!</content>
<content contentuid="h196d7f20g46a9g458bg83e6g2d58c07df326" version="1">I'll TEAR you apart!</content>
<content contentuid="h1dead036gd373g45a7g96c2g5fe58c9f8866" version="1">That all you've got, weakling?!</content>

<content contentuid="h54bd13d2gd225g4fd8ga486gf3c2c2794e35" version="1">Naarg... krall...</content>
<content contentuid="h50ef1897g3853g4f85gbc60ga42787316d59" version="1">Weak... ling...</content>
<content contentuid="h6d475bddgfdc0g4de9gabf3gc9509c1c9424" version="1">My mantle...</content>

</contentList>
